<title>AUSTRALIA: Future franking depends on profit mix-ANZ.</title>
<headline>Future franking depends on profit mix-ANZ.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia and New Zealand Banking Group Ltd said on Tuesday that while it expected to be able to fully frank its 1997 final dividend, future franking would depend on its profit mix.</p>
<p>&quot;There may be limits on franking capacity going forward, depending on the balance between Australian and offshore profits,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bank was denying newspaper claims that it had boosted its dividend arbitraging business in order to boost its franking capacity.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsrooom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
